    ('zn-bathroom-kit-3pcs-gun-grey-2', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0331/0321/6685/files/Capture_800x.jpg?v=1759234866', null),
    ('zn-drywall-paper-tape-2-1-16-x500', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0331/0321/6685/files/Drywall-Paper-Tape-7_800x.webp?v=1758745491', 'Drywall joint reinforcement Inside and outside corner finishing Crack and hole patching.'),
    ('zn-dust-free-hand-sander', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0331/0321/6685/files/0032043_dust-free-drywall-hand-sander-wvac-hook-up-kit_800x.jpg?v=1758744973', 'Building trade professionals, who build our homes and countries demand quality, innovation, and SATISFACTION from the tools they use every day. Goldblatt tool company has been helping meet that demand for over 130 years. Goldblatt tool company designs, manufactures, and distributes high quality trade tools in the masonry, concrete, drywall, tile, and paint tool categories to a worldwide market. This culture of quality and innovation with a firm commitment to research and development helps goldblatt consistently meet the specific needs of the professionals and consumers that we Serve throughout the world. Designed for use with Standard sanding screens. Adjustable vent allows for variable vacuum force. 360 Degree pivoting elbow for ease of use on vertical surfaces. Low-profile knobs stay out of the way. Lightweight with soft grip ergonomic handle includes 6 ft hose, coupler and adapter for compatibility with most shop-type vacuums.'),
