    ('zn-8-in-cnr-bright-white-frp', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0331/0321/6685/files/download_1_800x.png?v=1758743505', 'PVC Inside Corner Moulding is essential for creating a finished, professional look where FRP panels are joined at an inside corner. They provide a sanitary seam sealing open corners where dirt, stains and bacteria can collect. This curved corner design makes for easy cleaning. 8ft PVC Moulding, resists mould, mildew, bacteria and stains Required for CFIA accepted installation Suggested installations includes use of silicone caulk.'),
    ('zn-tyvek-homewrap-gen-9-x100', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0331/0321/6685/files/DUPONTTYVEK3X100HOMEWRAP-min_550x550_9a018315-79d7-4a7b-8757-6d5435965079_800x.webp?v=1758743328', 'DuPont Tyvek HomeWrap delivers the optimum balance of properties for superior performance against the elements. Tyvek HomeWrap helps prevent outside water from entering the walls and helps to seal the home to keep outside air where it belongs. DuPont Tyvek HomeWrap helps reduce homeowner energy bills because homes stay cool in the summer and warm in the winter and dry all year round. Tyvek® HomeWrap® helps protect a home against damaging wind and rain that can penetrate through the exterior cladding into the wall. The unique non-woven fibre structure of DuPont Tyvek® HomeWrap® stops air movement through the walls helping to reduce drafts, improve indoor air quality and providing a more energy efficient home. The breathable structure of Tyvek® HomeWrap® allows moisture vapour to escape helping to promote drying within the wall which can aid in preventing mould, mildew and water damage.'),
    ('zn-mapeguard-board-1-2-4-8', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0331/0321/6685/files/4_mapeguard-1_ca3a61ad6d5b4089bb77fba8fe2a70d6_800x.jpg?v=1758742881', 'Mapeguard Board is a multipurpose, premium-performance, lightweight, rigid, waterproof backer-board panel that is made with a high-density, extruded polystyrene core. This backer board features a high-strength, waterproof membrane and facer on both sides to provide water and vapor protection. Mapeguard Board is for use under ceramic tile and stone installations for both residential and commercial interior applications. The uniquely engineered, multi-layered design is available in thicknesses from 1/4" to 2" (6 mm to 5 cm) for use on walls, floors, ceilings and countertops, as well as for fabrication of room partitions, benches, seats and furnishing elements, delivering a dimensionally stable substrate. Attaches to wood or metal framing Lifetime system warranty when combined with other qualifying products Coated with a superior-performing waterproof membrane and facer Low perm rating; approved for use in steam rooms and showers Tab washers not required on floors and walls Easy to cut with a standard utility knife without mess Lightweight and easy to handle Available in multiple thicknesses.'),
    ('zn-mapeguard-board-1-2-3-5', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0331/0321/6685/files/4_mapeguard-1_ca3a61ad6d5b4089bb77fba8fe2a70d6_800x.jpg?v=1758742881', 'Mapeguard Board is a multipurpose, premium-performance, lightweight, rigid, waterproof backer-board panel that is made with a high-density, extruded polystyrene core. This backer board features a high-strength, waterproof membrane and facer on both sides to provide water and vapor protection. Mapeguard Board is for use under ceramic tile and stone installations for both residential and commercial interior applications. The uniquely engineered, multi-layered design is available in thicknesses from 1/4" to 2" (6 mm to 5 cm) for use on walls, floors, ceilings and countertops, as well as for fabrication of room partitions, benches, seats and furnishing elements, delivering a dimensionally stable substrate. Attaches to wood or metal framing Lifetime system warranty when combined with other qualifying products Coated with a superior-performing waterproof membrane and facer Low perm rating; approved for use in steam rooms and showers Tab washers not required on floors and walls Easy to cut with a standard utility knife without mess Lightweight and easy to handle Available in multiple thicknesses.'),
