    ('zn-100pc-stainless-steel-washers-for-xps-foam-board', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0331/0321/6685/files/0002649_5pc-xps-foam-tile-backer-board-12in-3ft-a-5ft_36a6d6e1-2601-4732-adc2-9437da4779eb_800x.jpg?v=1758735856', 'Tooltech® Xpert Stainless Steel Screws and Washers are used to quickly fasten Tooltech® Xpert XPS Tile Foam Backer Boards to the supporting studs. Washers should be recessed in the board slightly and covered with Single Sided Butyl Tape for a watertight installation. FEATURES. Spacing for installation at 16 in. horizontally and 12 in. vertically. Material: Stainless Steel. Size: 32mm Diameter. Quantity: 100 pieces.'),
    ('zn-100pc-stainless-steel-screws-for-xps-foam-board-8x40mm', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0331/0321/6685/files/0002649_5pc-xps-foam-tile-backer-board-12in-3ft-a-5ft_6e708a1e-d687-4f1c-9b68-ce9dff24aad3_800x.jpg?v=1758735764', 'Tooltech® Xpert Stainless Steel Screws and Washers are used to quickly fasten Tooltech® Xpert XPS Tile Foam Backer Boards to the supporting studs. FEATURES. Material: Stainless Steel. Flat Head Phillips Screws #8 x 40mm. Quantity: 100 pieces.'),
