    ('zn-4050-flexsil-multi-purpose-acrylic-primer-with-aggregates-13l', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0331/0321/6685/files/WechatIMG4-nDST3ogPD-x0nrbdJ-y_7e95a3f9-2b3d-4bdb-8bae-ba9414cad317_800x.jpg?v=1713991677', 'Flexsil Multipurpose Acrylic Primer is a high solids low VOC acrylic primer with inert aggregates polymers and specific additives. Flexsil Primer is used to prime various surfaces promoting adhesion especially to non-porous surfaces. It may be used to enhance bonding of cementitious and gypsum based levelers to various surfaces also suitable to enhance bonding of mortars and levelers to non-absorbant surfaces such as existing ceramic natural stone and terrazzo floors. Repairing cracked chipped or broken concrete. • Installing cementitiousself-leveling underlayments toppings or other such products over concrete surfaces.'),
    ('zn-4050-flexsil-multi-purpose-acrylic-primer-with-aggregates-3-8l', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0331/0321/6685/files/WechatIMG4-kHbJlpbFa-Tc7xDmDwT_2cc3a6b2-1510-47c1-814f-384aed89a3ed_800x.jpg?v=1713991675', 'Flexsil Multipurpose Acrylic Primer is a high solids low VOC acrylic primer with inert aggregates polymers and specific additives. Flexsil Primer is used to prime various surfaces promoting adhesion especially to non-porous surfaces. It may be used to enhance bonding of cementitious and gypsum based levelers to various surfaces also suitable to enhance bonding of mortars and levelers to non-absorbant surfaces such as existing ceramic natural stone and terrazzo floors. Repairing cracked chipped or broken concrete. • Installing cementitiousself-leveling underlayments toppings or other such products over concrete surfaces.'),
    ('zn-flextile-wp-900-hydro-bloc-waterproof-crack-isolation-membrane-4-l', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0331/0321/6685/files/WechatIMG1-1-qM8CtD0UP-EYeUPtJW_d85d155c-aefa-4289-aa79-2ac44fd0c4f5_800x.jpg?v=1713991672', 'WP-900 is a one-component flexible load bearing waterproofing latex compound applied by paint roller or quality paint brush to form a seamless waterproof membrane under ceramic tile and stone installations. As a Waterproof Membrane: For use under all ceramic tile and stone installations where a waterproof surface is required. Ideal for all wet areas such as bathrooms showers spas & steam rooms fountains pools countertops etc.'),
    ('zn-flextile-wp-900-hydro-bloc-waterproof-crack-isolation-membrane-20-l', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0331/0321/6685/files/WechatIMG1-1-x7YqxVv4V-mPrL-FrWs_0fe86cb9-073e-4385-a42b-d2617eba6ecc_800x.jpg?v=1713991670', 'WP-900 is a one-component flexible load bearing waterproofing latex compound applied by paint roller or quality paint brush to form a seamless waterproof membrane under ceramic tile and stone installations. As a Waterproof Membrane: For use under all ceramic tile and stone installations where a waterproof surface is required. Ideal for all wet areas such as bathrooms showers spas & steam rooms fountains pools countertops etc.'),
    ('zn-flextile-44-high-solids-latex-thin-set-mortar-additive-4-l', 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0331/0321/6685/files/WechatIMG3-1-nSlWNYAnc-v2fVf-dF_891860b4-2de5-47d0-9e26-1f4eed946a35_800x.jpg?v=1713991668', 'Flextile 44 is a Premium Solids Thin-Set Mortar Additive for use with Flextile 51 Premium Floor & Wall Thin-Set Mortar or with Flextile 53 Floor Mix for use in installing most ceramic tile and stone on properly prepared interior or exterior surfaces. The high latex solids content of Flextile 44 High Solids Thin-Set Mortar Additive increases safety margins on exterior applications where thermal expansion / contraction of tiles is a concern where extreme freeze / thaw conditions exist in water immersion applications and in other critical situations.'),
